  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "sc6.1_01",
      "scene_num": "6.1",
      "shot_idx": 1,
      "title": "Scene 6.1 Shot 01",
      "text": "第四個步驟，叫做行動，也就是說，你要根據上個步驟的決策，採取適當的後續行動。什麼後續行動呢？",
      "duration": 9.98,
      "start_seconds": 0.0,
      "end_seconds": 9.98,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc6.1_line_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc6.1_02",
      "scene_num": "6.1",
      "shot_idx": 2,
      "title": "Scene 6.1 Shot 02",
      "text": "有兩種可能，一種是「標準化並推廣」，另一種則是「重來一次PDCA」。",
      "duration": 6.24,
      "start_seconds": 9.98,
      "end_seconds": 16.22,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc6.1_line_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc6.2_01",
      "scene_num": "6.2",
      "shot_idx": 1,
      "title": "Scene 6.2 Shot 01",
      "text": "如果你在Check步驟中，判定你的對策是有效的！",
      "duration": 4.34,
      "start_seconds": 16.22,
      "end_seconds": 20.56,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc6.2_line_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc6.2_02",
      "scene_num": "6.2",
      "shot_idx": 2,
      "title": "Scene 6.2 Shot 02",
      "text": "那就應該把你的對策，制訂成SOP，或者融入現有的SOP。",
      "duration": 5.14,
      "start_seconds": 20.56,
      "end_seconds": 25.7,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc6.2_line_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc6.2_03",
      "scene_num": "6.2",
      "shot_idx": 3,
      "title": "Scene 6.2 Shot 03",
      "text": "以台鐵為例，相關工作可能包括：修改績效考核標準，修訂物料採購程序、提高工程規格、",
      "duration": 8.47,
      "start_seconds": 25.7,
      "end_seconds": 34.17,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc6.2_line_03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc6.2_04",
      "scene_num": "6.2",
      "shot_idx": 4,
      "title": "Scene 6.2 Shot 04",
      "text": "建立緊急應變程序等等。",
      "duration": 3.02,
      "start_seconds": 34.17,
      "end_seconds": 37.19,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc6.2_line_04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc6.2_05",
      "scene_num": "6.2",
      "shot_idx": 5,
      "title": "Scene 6.2 Shot 05",
      "text": "建立SOP有兩個優點：第一個優點是：提昇效率：如果將來問題再出現時，你不用實驗就可以直接引用，",
      "duration": 8.86,
      "start_seconds": 37.19,
      "end_seconds": 46.05,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc6.2_line_05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc6.2_06",
      "scene_num": "6.2",
      "shot_idx": 6,
      "title": "Scene 6.2 Shot 06",
      "text": "讓你可以在最短的時間內，以最有效的方法解決問題！第二個優點是：擴大應用：如果將來要進行大規模的推廣，",
      "duration": 10.51,
      "start_seconds": 46.05,
      "end_seconds": 56.56,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc6.2_line_06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc6.2_07",
      "scene_num": "6.2",
      "shot_idx": 7,
      "title": "Scene 6.2 Shot 07",
      "text": "就可以直接應用先前所建立的SOP，確保達到同樣品質！",
      "duration": 5.09,
      "start_seconds": 56.56,
      "end_seconds": 61.65,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc6.2_line_07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc6.3_01",
      "scene_num": "6.3",
      "shot_idx": 1,
      "title": "Scene 6.3 Shot 01",
      "text": "如果你在Check步驟中，判定你的對策是無效的。",
      "duration": 4.32,
      "start_seconds": 61.65,
      "end_seconds": 65.97,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc6.3_line_01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc6.3_02",
      "scene_num": "6.3",
      "shot_idx": 2,
      "title": "Scene 6.3 Shot 02",
      "text": "那就要執行新一輪的PDCA，重新分析原因，重新設計對策，然後再看看新的對策有沒有效！",
      "duration": 7.9,
      "start_seconds": 65.97,
      "end_seconds": 73.87,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc6.3_line_02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc6.3_03",
      "scene_num": "6.3",
      "shot_idx": 3,
      "title": "Scene 6.3 Shot 03",
      "text": "你可能會覺得，挖，還要再來一次喔，不就前功盡棄，浪費時間？其實並不會。",
      "duration": 8.09,
      "start_seconds": 73.87,
      "end_seconds": 81.96,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc6.3_line_03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc6.3_04",
      "scene_num": "6.3",
      "shot_idx": 4,
      "title": "Scene 6.3 Shot 04",
      "text": "因為即使這次PDCA沒有成功，我們也從實驗過程中獲得許多寶貴的知識與經驗，所以在新一輪的PDCA中，",
      "duration": 8.23,
      "start_seconds": 81.96,
      "end_seconds": 90.19,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc6.3_line_04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "sc6.3_05",
      "scene_num": "6.3",
      "shot_idx": 5,
      "title": "Scene 6.3 Shot 05",
      "text": "我們就有更充分的知識與經驗，可以作更精確的分析，並設計出更好的對策。距離成功，也就更進了一歨！",
      "duration": 9.58,
      "start_seconds": 90.19,
      "end_seconds": 99.77,
      "audio_file": "assets/audio/sc6.3_line_05.mp3"
    }
  ]
}